                            {
                                "target_word": "rather",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21b89ebe-2ce9-304d-9c9e-915f86f79a1c",
                                        "entry_id": "b481f76b-b907-3061-ac79-b235ede597bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An enthusiastic affirmation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "England",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f79ba04-9cb2-40a5-a253-f443764efa5e",
                                                "sense_id": "21b89ebe-2ce9-304d-9c9e-915f86f79a1c",
                                                "text": "Would you like some? –Rather!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d70ae8c1-4fac-41a8-9fc6-0066f8d94aa9",
                                                "sense_id": "21b89ebe-2ce9-304d-9c9e-915f86f79a1c",
                                                "text": "\"Do you mean to say, young man,\" she said frostily, \"that you expect me to drink this stuff?\" ¶ \"Rather! Bucks you up, you know.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c52c334-ae50-4874-8db0-f675b838de86",
                                                "sense_id": "21b89ebe-2ce9-304d-9c9e-915f86f79a1c",
                                                "text": "\"Farewell, Daughter of Eve,\" said he. \"Perhaps I may keep the handkerchief?\"\n\"Rather!\" said Lucy, and then ran towards the far-off patch of daylight as quickly as her legs would carry her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dab59a1-fc6a-4bdd-ae42-a73109f1fa53",
                                                "sense_id": "21b89ebe-2ce9-304d-9c9e-915f86f79a1c",
                                                "text": "\"Some of us stupid old die-hards believe that there is yet room for pride in one's work, Pook,\" Mr Pants said with dangerous emphasis. \"Oh, rather, sir. I'd much sooner walk to London Town than ride in one of those motorcars we've heard tell of, sir.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rather",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7965a997-2ad9-3f9e-835f-52a0c3667608",
                                        "entry_id": "73fef44a-32a0-31da-b6dd-542160463260",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A choice or a preference."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ec11a93-e641-46bd-a5fe-0a46e4e5ee84",
                                                "sense_id": "7965a997-2ad9-3f9e-835f-52a0c3667608",
                                                "text": "If I had my rathers I'd make up my own band. Art Blakey on the skins, Charlie Mingus on the bass, John Coltrane on the sax, Harry Edison on the horn-"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d3e7cf1-a606-4e19-a2a8-2dae41b3a257",
                                                "sense_id": "7965a997-2ad9-3f9e-835f-52a0c3667608",
                                                "text": "I would rather do it by myself. I would rather, if I had my rathers, not be seen doing it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rather",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bff9390-9756-3449-866c-c30f94db5483",
                                        "entry_id": "c364ad14-db50-3b53-9372-21672ed0ff3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To prefer; to prefer to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dialectal",
                                            "nonstandard"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c96b60d9-bb01-4863-94e8-82ff23938e02",
                                                "sense_id": "6bff9390-9756-3449-866c-c30f94db5483",
                                                "text": "Until just before the pie was popped into the heat. A few of them suddenly realized who put that gorgeous hunk of crackers together, and gaped. We grinned back, but very cool. The ones who knew said nothing, rathering to die than let on they had been hustled by two negative dudes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c001f78b-494c-4c04-b8ce-c545cc3fa148",
                                                "sense_id": "6bff9390-9756-3449-866c-c30f94db5483",
                                                "text": "It was a plain brown dress, more or less the colour of my hair; and the walls of our kitchen being also brown, when I came downstairs again I could hardly be seen. I should have rathered a blue gown, or a violet one; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cfa4f28-aa43-433f-af5c-00f7992a7734",
                                                "sense_id": "6bff9390-9756-3449-866c-c30f94db5483",
                                                "text": "So you must excuse my saying anything I did: all it was, that up to the very last I had understood us all to be friendly — apart, that is, from his rathering me not there. How was I to know he would flash out so wicked?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "745c3584-2357-4e31-83db-810506e24f45",
                                                "sense_id": "6bff9390-9756-3449-866c-c30f94db5483",
                                                "text": "\"That was a killer,\" said Chris. \"I'd rathered die in St. Bernard than spent one minute over there. I would have rathered the storm, shaking with the wind and rain hitting in the boat for an eternity than spending any time there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
